lame AI.</h3><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Website delivery and ongoing support for a B2B marketing team. Our Astro work follows the same discipline.</p><span class=\"text-link\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>View the case study <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>↗</span></span></a></div></section><section class=\"astro-detail astro-detail--dark section\" id=\"visibility\" aria-labelledby=\"visibility-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"container detail-grid detail-grid--reverse\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"detail-copy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Search &amp; AI visibility</span><h2 data-no-roll id=\"visibility-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>SEO and AI visibility for Astro websites.</h2><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>An Astro website still needs useful content and a sound SEO setup. We plan page titles, internal links, sitemaps and structured data around the searches that matter to your business.</p><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Answer engine optimisation (AEO) builds on that work. We check how ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude describe your business, improve the pages buyers need, and track citations alongside visits and enquiries.</p><ul class=\"detail-list\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Buyer-question research and a visibility baseline</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Service pages, useful content and technical improvements</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>AI citation monitoring and source checks</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Reporting that connects findings to the next action</li></ul><div class=\"astro-actions\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/?service=aeo\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Discuss your visibility</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"quiet-link\" href=\"/services/search-ai-visibility/\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Explore our approach <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>↗</span></a></div></div><div class=\"service-visual visibility-visual\" data-astro-motion role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative AI visibility report with example data: 18 of 30 answers cite a website, or 60 percent. ChatGPT 6 of 8, Perplexity 5 of 8, Gemini 4 of 7 and Claude 3 of 7. These are example figures, not client results.\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"visual-caption\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Illustrative visibility report · example data</span><div class=\"visibility-top\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"widget-label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Answers citing your website</span><strong data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>60<small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>%</small></strong><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>18 of 30 monitored answers</p></div><svg class=\"visibility-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><circle class=\"score-track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></circle><circle class=\"score-line\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"40\" pathLength=\"100\" stroke-dasharray=\"60 100\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></circle><path d=\"m38 51 8 8 17-19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></path></svg></div><div class=\"engine-breakdown\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"engine-breakdown__heading\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>AI engine</span><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Answers citing the site</span></div><div class=\"engine-metric\" style=\"--delay:0s\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><img src=\"/img/engines/chatgpt.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>ChatGPT</span><div class=\"engine-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i style=\"width:75%\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i></div><b data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>6<small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c> / 8</small></b></div><div class=\"engine-metric\" style=\"--delay:-1.4s\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><img src=\"/img/engines/perplexity.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Perplexity</span><div class=\"engine-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i style=\"width:62.5%\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i></div><b data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>5<small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c> / 8</small></b></div><div class=\"engine-metric\" style=\"--delay:-2.8s\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><img src=\"/img/engines/gemini.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Gemini</span><div class=\"engine-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i style=\"width:57.14285714285714%\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i></div><b data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>4<small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c> / 7</small></b></div><div class=\"engine-metric\" style=\"--delay:-4.199999999999999s\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><img src=\"/img/engines/claude.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Claude</span><div class=\"engine-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i style=\"width:42.857142857142854%\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i></div><b data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>3<small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c> / 7</small></b></div></div><div class=\"visibility-process\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i>Review sources</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>→</b><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i>Improve content</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>→</b><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i>Recheck</span></div><p class=\"visibility-footnote\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Each citation links back to the answer and its source.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"astro-detail section\" id=\"applications\" aria-labelledby=\"applications-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"container detail-grid\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"detail-copy\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Custom web applications</span><h2 data-no-roll id=\"applications-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Custom applications connected to your Astro website.</h2><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Let customers book a session, manage their account or complete a process online. We design and build applications around the people using them and the team running the service.</p><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>That can mean a coaching platform with sessions and progress, a customer portal, or an internal workflow connected to your existing tools.</p><ul class=\"detail-list\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Bookings, payments and customer accounts</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Roles, permissions and administration</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Integrations with the tools your business uses</li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>A scoped first release, with testing and ongoing support</li></ul><p class=\"detail-note\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>We scope authentication, data and integrations before choosing the stack. Astro supports server-rendered features and interactive components; the application architecture follows the complexity of your service.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/?service=app\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Discuss your application</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"service-visual application-visual\" data-astro-motion role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative coaching platform with a session booking, programme progress and coach administration. This is an example interface, not a client case study.\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"visual-caption\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Example platform, illustrative interface</span><div class=\"app-window\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"app-sidebar\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"app-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>↗</span><span class=\"active\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Overview</span><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Sessions</span><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Progress</span><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Resources</span></div><div class=\"app-content\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"app-greeting\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>YOUR PROGRAMME</span><strong data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Make time for<br data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>your next step.</strong><div class=\"session-card\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Upcoming session</span><b data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Leadership coaching</b><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Thursday · 10:00</span><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Online</i></div><span class=\"visual-button\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>View session <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>↗</span></span></div><div class=\"progress-card\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Your programme</span><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i><i data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></i></div><small data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Sessions and resources in one place</small></div></div></div><div class=\"admin-slip\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>✓</span><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><strong data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Built for both sides</strong><span data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>A customer experience your team can manage.</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"astro-process section\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"section-heading\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>A clear route to launch</span><h2 data-no-roll id=\"process-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Our Astro development process.</h2><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Your publishing needs, integrations and support requirements shape the recommendation. We explain where Astro fits and where another platform makes more sense.</p></div><ol class=\"process-grid\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"process-number\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>01</span><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Share the goal</h3><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Tell us what needs to improve, who will use it and the constraints on budget or timing.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"process-number\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>02</span><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Review the plan</h3><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Agree the scope, design, platform, costs and responsibilities before development starts.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"process-number\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>03</span><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Launch with a handover</h3><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Test the key journeys, train your team and agree how the site or application will be supported.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"astro-faq section\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div class=\"container faq-grid\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Before we begin</span><h2 data-no-roll id=\"faq-title\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Planning your Astro website.</h2></div><div class=\"faq-items\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Is Astro a good choice for a B2B marketing website?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Astro suits content-heavy websites and teams that want ownership of their code. We plan the CMS, publishing controls and ongoing support around the people running the site. Our own website runs on Astro; our Webflow Enterprise experience informs the design systems and handover.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Can our marketing team edit an Astro site without a developer?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Yes, with a connected CMS and an agreed set of page sections. Your team can edit content, preview changes and publish within that system. We establish who needs to edit what before recommending the CMS, and include training in the handover.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>How does Astro compare with Webflow?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Webflow offers visual page editing and managed hosting. Astro gives your team ownership of the code and flexibility over hosting, content and integrations. We work with both. The choice depends on your publishing needs, application requirements and who will maintain the site.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>What does it cost to host an Astro site?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Hosting costs depend on traffic and the features the site needs. A static marketing site can have low running costs; a platform may also need a database, authentication, payments and other services. The proposal names those services, their expected costs and the support required.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Can you move our existing site to Astro?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Yes. We review the existing content and integrations, rebuild the page templates, and map old URLs to their new destinations. Redirects and key journeys are checked before launch. Search performance is monitored after the switch, with any issues investigated.</p></details><details data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><summary data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><h3 data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>What happens after launch?</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>+</span></summary><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>You keep the source code, accounts and build documentation. We can agree ongoing development, maintenance, search and AI visibility work, or hand the site over to your team. For applications, support includes the services and integrations agreed in the scope.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"astro-close section\" data-astro-closer data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><canvas class=\"astro-close__dither\" data-astro-dither width=\"1\" height=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" hidden data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c></canvas><div class=\"container close-grid\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><div data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Your next project</span><h2 data-no-roll data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Tell us about<br data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>your Astro project.</h2><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Share your goals, current website and the support you need. We will review your enquiry and recommend the next step.</p></div><div class=\"close-action\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Discuss your project</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><p data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Astro development, search visibility or a connected application.</p><a class=\"quiet-link\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>Prefer to book a call? <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-jg2u4s4c>↗</span></a></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }","html.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}"]}
